                                        <p>
                                            Regularity love this service. They’re prompt, thorough, and friendly. I can trust them to clean my home exactly how I want it. Plus, they’re affordable and use safe.
                                        </p>
                                        <div class="tm-provider">
                                            <h2>James Baker</h2>
                                            <span>Founder, Meriston Capital Ltd.</span>
                                        </div>
                                   </div>
                                </div>
                                <!-- Single Item -->
